# PR Review Bot — local environment configuration
# ------------------------------------------------
# Copy this file to .env and fill in the key for whichever provider you want to use.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# The bot auto-detects the provider from whichever key is present.
# If you set more than one key, pass --provider explicitly:
#
#   python review.py --provider groq
#
# .env is listed in .gitignore and will never be committed.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Google Gemini
# Get your key at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# Default model:   gemini-2.0-flash
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GEMINI_API_KEY=AIza...

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Groq  (fastest inference, great for quick PR reviews)
# Get your key at: https://console.groq.com/keys
# Default model:   llama-3.3-70b-versatile
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OpenRouter  (access to many models via one key)
# Get your key at: https://openrouter.ai/keys
# Default model:   google/gemini-2.0-flash-001
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...
